    "<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">以下題目依序增加難度。建議先自行列出溶解平衡式、判斷濃度關係，再進行計算。</p>\n<div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-has-border=\"\" style=\"border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-lg); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"between\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">第 </strong><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">1</strong><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\"> 題</strong></span></p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"xs\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">基礎應用</p></div>某難溶性鹽類 M(OH)₂ 的 Ksp 為 3.2×10⁻¹²。假設 OH⁻ 完全來自該鹽類，求其在純水中的莫耳溶解度。<div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-wrap=\"wrap\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"sm\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">提示</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"sm\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">參考解答</span></button></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-md); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1);\">",
    "<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">參考解答</p>Ksp=4s³，所以 s=(3.2×10⁻¹²/4)^(1/3)≈9.28×10⁻⁵ M。這裡依題意忽略水的自解離。</div></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-has-border=\"\" style=\"border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-lg); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"between\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">第 </strong><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">2</strong><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\"> 題</strong></span></p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"xs\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">基礎應用</p></div>將 100 mL、0.020 M 的 AgNO₃ 與 100 mL、0.010 M 的 NaCl 混合。已知 Ksp(AgCl)=1.8×10⁻¹⁰。判斷是否沉澱，並估算平衡時剩餘的 Ag⁺ 濃度。<div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-wrap=\"wrap\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"sm\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">提示</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"sm\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">參考解答</span></button></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-md); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">參考解答</p>",
    "初始混合後 [Ag⁺]=0.010 M、[Cl⁻]=0.0050 M，Qsp=5.0×10⁻⁵&gt;Ksp。Ag⁺ 過量約 0.0050 M，平衡時 [Ag⁺]≈0.0050 M；殘餘 [Cl⁻]≈3.6×10⁻⁸ M。</div></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-has-border=\"\" style=\"border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-lg); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"between\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">第 </strong><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">3</strong><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\"> 題</strong></span></p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"xs\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">比較分析</p></div>兩種鹽類 AB 與 CD₂ 的 Ksp 分別為 9.0×10⁻¹⁰ 與 4.0×10⁻¹²。比較兩者在純水中的莫耳溶解度，並說明為何不能直接比較 Ksp。<div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-wrap=\"wrap\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"sm\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">提示</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"sm\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">參考解答</span></button></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-md); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">參考解答</p>AB：s=3.0×10⁻⁵ M。CD₂：s=1.0×10⁻⁴ M。因此 CD₂ 溶解度較大。不同化學計量比例的 Ksp 與 s 關係不同。</div></div>",
    "<div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-has-border=\"\" style=\"border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-lg); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"between\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\"><span class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-default-strong=\"\" data-d-inline=\"\"><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">第 </strong><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\">4</strong><strong class=\"Emphasis-BHzYtQ\"> 題</strong></span></p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"xs\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">進階整合</p></div>某溶液含 0.010 M 的 M²⁺ 與 0.010 M 的 N²⁺。其氫氧化物的 Ksp 分別為 1.0×10⁻¹⁰ 與 1.0×10⁻¹⁶。逐漸增加 OH⁻ 濃度時，哪種離子先沉澱？當另一種剛開始沉澱時，先沉澱的離子還剩多少？<div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-wrap=\"wrap\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"sm\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">提示</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"secondary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"sm\" data-d-component=\"button\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">參考解答</span></button></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-md); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">參考解答</p>N(OH)₂ 先沉澱，其臨界 [OH⁻]=1.0×10⁻⁷ M。M(OH)₂ 的臨界值為 1.0×10⁻⁴ M。此時 [N²⁺]=10⁻¹⁶/(10⁻⁴)²=1.0×10⁻⁸ M，剩餘原濃度的 0.0001%。此題將 OH⁻ 視為可獨立控制，忽略其他平衡。</div></div></div>"
